# Boundary-Contract:
# - Owns:
#   - Dense normalizer-free and exact ranking for the single-transposition
#     stabilizer in the top-level all-equal S6 stratum.
# - Must-Not:
#   - Materialize the million-entry S3 exclusion-rank set.
# - Allows:
#   - Inputs: H-fixed residual assignments for H generated by transposition 01.
#   - Outputs: free N(H)/H ranks, exact-H ranks, and complete outer ranks.
#   - Side effects: none.
# - Split-When:
#   - Exact S3 exception ranking requires an independently reusable primitive.
# - Merge-When:
#   - Complete dense full-S6 ranking owns every exact stabilizer stratum.
# - Summary:
#   - Rank H-fixed assignments freely, then remove S3 extensions by frontier DP.
# - Description:
#   - An optimal block order leaves at most three live S3 equalities.
# - Usage:
#   - Constructive rank for the dominant proper symmetric S6 stabilizer type.
# - Defaults:
#   - Exact residual and complete rank/unrank reach total mass fourteen.
#

"""Dense exact rank for the full-S6 single-transposition stabilizer stratum."""

